ta's chance this season to make his comeback…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-03-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ldkl5pAR4nOZEqA2YTBvALH4fJE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ldkl5pAR4nOZEqA2YTBvALH4fJE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45247/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"898119","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mizusawa's next opponent is a group of geniuses that has been sweeping the Karuta scene.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-03-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nKNmuiWyXzN9Uci9GMQAilxY1Yn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nKNmuiWyXzN9Uci9GMQAilxY1Yn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45247/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"898118","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mizusawa has finally made it to the first round of the High School Championship playoffs. However, Porky says that they should play without Desk-kun. After looking at Desk-kun's notebook, she agrees that they should leave him out of the lineup. Their opponent is Shoyo High school, representing Kyoto. Will Porky and Desk-kun be able to make peace?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-03-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oc39PYREfJ7CuhY9FgMylrKPnyT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oc39PYREfJ7CuhY9FgMylrKPnyT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45247/season/2/episode/11"},{"id":"898116","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In the second round of the playoffs, Mizusawa faces off against Akashi Girls First, led by Ousaka Megumu, the West representative in the previous Queen match qualifier. Chihaya falls behind off the bat as Megumu displays speed that she didn't have before. Will Chihaya be able to use all of her hard work to change the momentum?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-03-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8mmhRwh8r9zIqbi0nkMUDkkacdA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8mmhRwh8r9zIqbi0nkMUDkkacdA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45247/season/2/episode/12"},{"id":"898123","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Chihaya appears to have recovered from her bad start, but Megumu will not let her take  consecutive cards. As the players spur on their aces, both sides begin to pull together as  teams. Which team will prove to be stronger?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-04-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jzYw3HqZfm8BHflkeGVZwB0Jssi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jzYw3HqZfm8BHflkeGVZwB0Jssi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45247/season/2/episode/13"},{"id":"898121","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mizusawa and Akashi's match has reached the tipping point and each side starts winning games; the pressure between Chihaya and Megumu have captivated the crowd.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-04-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kIm5Qzkt5BSdqnlW7qxOd6IU11z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kIm5Qzkt5BSdqnlW7qxOd6IU11z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45247/season/2/epis